It's a strapless dress with a lace jacket.

586
00:27:45.340 --> 00:27:47.200
Angela's hair is half up, half down.

587
00:27:47.960 --> 00:27:49.920
This was a very fun wardrobe fitting.

588
00:27:50.100 --> 00:27:51.480
I still have the pictures from it.

589
00:27:52.300 --> 00:27:57.300
And, of course, Kim Ferry wanted to do a little classic mini bun swoop.

590
00:27:57.360 --> 00:28:00.920
So her hair is half up, half down with a cute little knot.

591
00:28:01.160 --> 00:28:01.680
I saw it.

592
00:28:01.740 --> 00:28:02.280
I loved it.

593
00:28:02.320 --> 00:28:05.060
It was a great detail and a call back to the character.

594
00:28:05.300 --> 00:28:05.680
Mm-hmm.

595
00:28:06.360 --> 00:28:12.160
Well, Phyllis is going to tell Angela, I'm going to get you to the altar and you can take

596
00:28:12.160 --> 00:28:13.060
that to the bank.

597
00:28:13.440 --> 00:28:13.880
Yes.

598
00:28:14.080 --> 00:28:18.620
I have such a clear memory of Phyllis saying you can take that to the bank.

599
00:28:18.820 --> 00:28:22.500
She was so proud that she was going to take care of things.

600
00:28:22.620 --> 00:28:24.520
And it was a really sweet moment.

601
00:28:25.140 --> 00:28:28.140
Well, now we're going to go to the groom's dressing room.

602
00:28:29.060 --> 00:28:30.000
Dwight's getting ready.

603
00:28:30.380 --> 00:28:31.360
Jim is helping him.

604
00:28:31.520 --> 00:28:33.920
We have a call back, another little Easter egg.

605
00:28:34.580 --> 00:28:37.680
Dwight does his air guitar to pump himself up.

606
00:28:37.820 --> 00:28:38.540
Oh, yes.

607
00:28:38.720 --> 00:28:39.460
I love that.

608
00:28:39.540 --> 00:28:40.880
He's like, I was born ready.

609
00:28:40.920 --> 00:28:45.380
And it's that call back to what he would do in the stairwell before there was a big meeting.

610
00:28:45.680 --> 00:28:47.340
Well, Jim's going to give him some news.

611
00:28:47.540 --> 00:28:53.100
He says, I just found out that I cannot be your bestest mensch because the bestest mensch

612
00:28:53.100 --> 00:28:54.860
has to be older than the groom.

613
00:28:55.220 --> 00:28:56.340
What are we going to do?

614
00:28:56.920 --> 00:28:59.000
Rain and John are really funny in this scene.

615
00:28:59.180 --> 00:28:59.640
They are.

616
00:28:59.860 --> 00:29:03.140
When John as Jim is like, I'm significantly younger than you.

617
00:29:03.140 --> 00:29:05.920
And Dwight's like, I don't know if I'd say that significantly.

618
00:29:05.920 --> 00:29:07.380
Maybe a teeny bit.

619
00:29:08.640 --> 00:29:12.200
That's when Jim says, I just really wish there was something I could do.

620
00:29:12.320 --> 00:29:14.840
And then his eyes kind of look off.

621
00:29:15.260 --> 00:29:16.880
The camera pans over.

622
00:29:17.160 --> 00:29:18.060
And guess who's there?

623
00:29:18.540 --> 00:29:19.520
Michael Scott.

624
00:29:19.720 --> 00:29:20.560
I know.

625
00:29:20.720 --> 00:29:23.260
And Dwight says, Michael, I can't believe you came.

626
00:29:23.700 --> 00:29:25.640
And Michael says, that's what she said.

627
00:29:25.900 --> 00:29:29.940
And that's the last time Steve Carell ever said, that's what she said.

628
00:29:29.940 --> 00:29:31.920
He has not said it since.

629
00:29:32.060 --> 00:29:33.160
That was the last time.

630
00:29:33.520 --> 00:29:34.700
Well, it was perfect.

631
00:29:34.980 --> 00:29:37.700
If that's going to be your last one, that's a great way to go.

632
00:29:37.980 --> 00:29:38.360
Perfect.

633
00:29:38.820 --> 00:29:41.160
Jim says, best prank ever.

634
00:29:41.700 --> 00:29:43.880
Now it's time for the wedding ceremony.

635
00:29:44.200 --> 00:29:45.720
The processional begins.

